SRR3027667	PRJNA306222	SRP067494	SAMN04348510	SRX1488719	Mus musculus	79 HA	79 HA	NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM1974203: 79 HA Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	NextSeq 500	HA and FT samples underwent on-column DNA digestion using the RNase-Free Dnase Set (Qiagen) and RNA purified with the RNeasy Micro kit (Qiagen). Integrity of the eluted RNA was analyzed by a 2100 Bioanalyzer (Agilent) using the RNA Pico chip. RNA concentration determined by RiboGreen RNA Assay kit (Life Technologies). cDNA was generated from 5ng of IP or FT RNA using the Nugen Ovation® 2 RNA-Seq Sytstem V2 kit (Nugen). 1 ug of cDNA was fragmented using the Covaris M220. Paired-end libraries for multiplex sequencing were generated from 300 ng of fragmented cDNA using the Apollo 324 automated library preparation system (Wafergen Biosystems), enriched over 10 cycles of PCR cycles and purified with Agencourt AMPure XP beads (Beckman Coulter).	61779256	9210125140	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR302/007/SRR3027667/SRR3027667_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR302/007/SRR3027667/SRR3027667_2.fastq.gz	e129e715316ffbb14e3ccb00f3430149;581ec56b8a3ce35815846c33eabedc76	2415467874;2538712549
